<p>As you continue to attune your body to undeath you reject nature as a whole.</p><p>As long as you have no natural infusion on your skin, each rune on it increases your minimum negative life by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">-8, -15, -21, -25, -30</acronym> and your spells critical chance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.0%, 1.3%, 1.5%, 1.6%, 1.8%.</acronym></p><p></p><p>Currently: effects disabled because of no rune</p>